Package: WSSmod
Title: Weighted Sum of Scores for Protein Network Modules
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Robert", "Butler", , "rrbutler@stanford.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to construct Weighted Sum of Scores (WSS) module-level
    summaries from proteomic data, using STRING network connectivity and
    biomarker-association weighting to align and aggregate protein-level
    signal into module scores.
